-- akn:preamble/p15 Ben-Gurion University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p16 The University of Haifa, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 Tel Aviv University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p18 The Technion, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p19 The Weizmann Institute, its representative left blank; no rule.
