§§ `נספח 5 — כתב הצטרפות`

-- akn:attachments The annexes' frame: a label row.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 The annex's label, "נספח 5'"; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 "To"; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 The chief labour-relations officer; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p6 The Ministry of Economy and Industry; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/t1 Blanks for the date and the signature on the employer's behalf; no rule.

-- ¶1: it replaces annex ב' of the 2016 agreement and the 8.8.2016
-- amendment's. ¶3, ¶8, ¶9: an accession to the framework of 18.4.2016 "as
-- amended on 8.8.2016 and on 9.1.2018" — the day of this agreement. ¶7: it
-- is for a "funded" or "supported" body with no wage agreement for
-- 1.1.2013–31.12.2017, or one for no more than 6 months of it; its footnote:
-- one with a longer agreement joins with changes the wages commissioner
-- approves. ¶10: an employer that signed the original letter, or the one
-- of 8.8.2016, joins the agreement as amended, and this letter replaces
-- the earlier (the day of the amendment is left blank). ¶11: it joins every
-- provision, as a whole, by each section's reach. ¶12: notwithstanding §7,
-- the frame is computed for all its employees the Histadrut represents
-- together, unless otherwise agreed with the trade-union division's
-- chairman's approval (and for a funded or supported body, the wages
-- commissioner's). ¶13: the grant's first part (§5.2.1), if unpaid, is paid
-- in the salary of the month after signing, at the latest the next.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p8 akn:att_1__hc_1/p9
`the day the 2018 letter dates the framework's amendment` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 9 1 2018

#ASSERT `the day the 2018 letter dates the framework's amendment` EQUALS `the 2018 framework amendment was signed on`

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p7
GIVEN `a funded or supported body` IS A BOOLEAN, `months of its wage agreement in 2013–2017` IS A NUMBER, `the wages commissioner approved changes` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an employer may join by the 2018 letter` `a funded or supported body` `months of its wage agreement in 2013–2017` `the wages commissioner approved changes` IF
        `a funded or supported body`
    AND (`months of its wage agreement in 2013–2017` AT MOST 6 OR `the wages commissioner approved changes`)

#ASSERT `an employer may join by the 2018 letter` TRUE 0 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `an employer may join by the 2018 letter` TRUE 12 FALSE

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p10 akn:att_1__hc_1/p11
`the 2018 letter replaces an earlier one its signer signed` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p12
GIVEN `otherwise agreed with the chairman's approval` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a joiner of 2018 computes its frame for all its Histadrut employees together` `otherwise agreed with the chairman's approval` IF
    NOT `otherwise agreed with the chairman's approval`

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p13
GIVEN `the month it signed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last salary month a joiner of 2018 pays the grant's first part in` `the month it signed` IS
    `the month it signed` PLUS 2

§§ `נספחים 1–4 ו־6–8 — טבלאות הגמלאים`

-- The pensioners' tables (§13; §§18–19 for the separate agreements): for
-- each last month of service from 1.2013 to 11.2019, the coefficient X in
-- all, and for each stage of the frame its part and the running total to
-- it — the first stage its part alone — blank for the stages before the
-- month. Annex 1 is the framework's ("מסגרת כללי"), the amended annex ו'
-- of §13 ¶2; 2 and 3 the social workers' (in general and in hospitals), 4
-- the administrative scale's, 6 and 7 the two medical-professions
-- agreements', 8 the senior academic staff's in the universities. The
-- corpus prints them in the copy's order: 8, then 1–4, then 6 and 7. Each
-- is DATA, as the corpus publishes it: the row's printed number, its month
-- and year as printed (NOTHING where annex 4 prints a year cut to three
-- digits, "10.201", or a month the corpus marks illegible), X in all, and
-- the stage cells in the page's order.
@desc A row of a pensioners' table of 9.1.2018: its printed number, the last month of service as printed, X in all, and each stage's cells in the page's order.
DECLARE `pensioners' row of 2018` HAS
    `the printed number of 2018`     IS A NUMBER
    `the printed month of 2018`      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `the printed year of 2018`       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `X in all of 2018`               IS A NUMBER
    `the stage cells of 2018`        IS A LIST OF MAYBE NUMBER

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, m IS A MAYBE NUMBER, y IS A MAYBE NUMBER, x IS A NUMBER, cs IS A LIST OF MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `pensioners' row of 2018`
DECIDE `a pensioners' row of 2018` n m y x cs IS
    `pensioners' row of 2018` WITH
        `the printed number of 2018` IS n
        `the printed month of 2018`  IS m
        `the printed year of 2018`   IS y
        `X in all of 2018`           IS x
        `the stage cells of 2018`    IS cs

